OL,3,GNEWSABillionaire Man United owner says
OL,4,Ahe has lost confidence in the UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response to the billionaire's
OL,7,Fcriticism, the government said it was
OL,8,Fworking to deliver growth and that
OL,9,Fbusiness investment had increased in
OL,10,Fthe last two years.
